      "error_message": "Face not detected on second site even though worker is assigned to it",
      "file": "frontend/lib/db.ts, frontend/hooks/useSiteSync.ts",
      "root_cause": "IndexedDB workers table used 'id' as primary key. Worker assigned to two sites has the same id — bulkAdd throws BulkError on second site sync. Catch block falls to offline cache which returns empty workers for the new site. setWorkers([]) → matcher = null → face never matched.",
